h)\n[01:35.26] You got a new bitch? Well, my bitch is newer (Uh-huh)\n[01:37.74] Make your bitch look like some shit (Ooh)\n[01:39.28] Cow manure\n[Chorus]\n[01:39.98] I say, I'ma secure the bag, do the dash, uh-huh (Uh-huh)\n[01:43.32] I take Percocets when I feel alone, uh (Uh-huh)\n[01:46.44] Mix it with Promethazine, carry me home (Oh)\n[01:49.70] R.I.P. to all my niggas dead and gone (Dead and gone, oh)\n[01:52.76] I can't take the pain, numb my shit again (Shit again, uh-huh)\n[01:55.76] I could take your main, go and put your digits in (Put your digits in, uh-huh)\n[01:58.88] I'm gon' take her and give her back, call it karma (Uh-huh, yeah)\n[02:01.66] I take this hurt inside my heart, spend it on designer (Designer, yeah, oh-oh)\n[Verse 2]\n[02:04.12] Yeah, I'm gon' take her and give her back, call it karma (Oh, oh, one take)\n[02:08.16] Not from Earth, baby, I am a Martian (Yeah, yeah, one take)\n[02:11.36] Tesla, I don't gotta steer when I park it, uh (Yeah, yeah, skrrt, skrrt, skrrt)\n[02:14.42] OG in the air, I love when I spark it (Yeah, yeah, let's do it)\n[02:17.90] Flew my OG out to Cali' (Uh-huh, skrrt, skrrt, uh)\n[02:19.66] I bought her a Lambo' (Uh-huh), uh\n[02:20.66] Also bought her a AK-47 (Yeah, yeah), I call her Rambo, uh (Uh-huh)\n[02:23.74] Niggas stick to me like velcro (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[02:25.42] Bitches stick like velcro, uh\n[02:26.84] Say he gettin' money? (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[02:28.22] Hell no, he still buying Shell Toes, uh (Uh-huh)\n[02:30.02] Raf's on my Adidas, uh (What else?)\n[02:31.48] Spanish bitch, that's my amiga, uh (What else?)\n[02:33.18] I got a bad bitch with stripes, she mixed, I call her a cheetah, uh (What else?)\n[02:36.22] Hotter than a nigga with a fever, uh (Uh)\n[02:37.76] She do white, Justin Bieber, uh (Uh-uh)\n[02:39.36] Bitch, I'm off of the meter, uh (Uh)\n[02:40.98] I got my hand on my heater, uh (Uh-huh)\n[02:42.48] Microwave, call that choppa microwave, heat 'em up (Up)\n[02:45.56] Like a